abstract: >-
  MOPAC_RS is a ground-up Data-Oriented Programming (DOP) reimagining and modernization
  of the classic MOPAC quantum chemistry engine in Rust. It features zero-heap-allocation
  iterative Roothaan-Hall SCF cycles, full NDDO diatomic 22-multipole integrals with 3D
  rotational transformations, COSMO implicit solvation, Grimme D3-BJ empirical dispersion,
  H4 hydrogen bonding, L-BFGS Cartesian geometry optimization, and high-performance PyO3
  Python bindings natively interoperable with RDKit and the Atomic Simulation Environment (ASE).
